{"repositoryId":674153903,"availability":"available","full":"modelscope/ms-agent","name":"ms-agent","description":"MS-Agent: a lightweight framework to empower agentic execution of complex tasks","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":4412,"forks":532,"created":"2023-08-03T09:06:03Z","updated":"2026-09-21T13:18:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ms-agent-en.readthedocs.io","topics":["agentic-insight","agentic-search","chat-bot","code-generation","deep-research","memory"],"demo":"https://modelscope.cn/mcp/playground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.558Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.558Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.558Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.558Z","stars":4412,"forks":532}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Homepage | MCP Playground | Paper | Documentation | 中文文档","MS-Agent is a modular, extensible open-source agent framework built for complex, long-running tasks. Combine models, tools, skills, and sub-agents with a customizable harness to build a productivity assistant tailored to your work. The harness manages planning, context, permissions, and execution feedback, while project memory and autonomous scheduling help the assistant keep complex tasks moving forward.","A shared Python SDK handles execution and management for the CLI, TUI, and WebUI, so you can reuse agent logic and extensions across terminals, browser workspaces, and business applications with less integration and maintenance work."],"features":["An extensible runtime brings together tool execution, permission checks, and feedback. Use lifecycle callbacks and Hooks to integrate business rules, validate plans, and check results. Customize how agents act, when…","Manage session history, active context, and project memory as distinct layers. Preserve full records while pruning tool output and compacting older context, then draw on project memory in later tasks. Cron supports…","Let a lead agent delegate open-ended tasks to specialist sub-agents, or define stages and dependencies with sequential workflows or directed acyclic graphs (DAGs). Choose models, tools, and skills for each role to suit…","Package domain knowledge and procedures into skills loaded on demand and reused across tasks. A dedicated Skill Evolution workflow uses execution traces and evaluation feedback to revise skills, then tests candidate…","Connect to multiple model providers, use MCP for external tools, integrate with editors and other agents through ACP / A2A, and extend functionality with plugins. Agent Hub converts, merges, and synchronizes…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f49069980731717b2645c315871fbc227c0347c253bde0cbf2c213b64179a794","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.614Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:55.614Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Homepage | MCP Playground | Paper | Documentation | 中文文档","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"MS-Agent is a modular, extensible open-source agent framework built for complex, long-running tasks. Combine models, tools, skills, and sub-agents with a customizable harness to build a productivity assistant tailored to your work. The harness manages planning, context, permissions, and execution feedback, while project memory and autonomous scheduling help the assistant keep…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-agent/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"If you have installed WebUI, skip environment creation and source installation, and configure your API key in the same environment.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/modelscope/ms-agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"WebUI users can then run ms-agent ui; terminal and SDK users also need to set their API k